# Save chats into the folder too

Cursor stores live chats **outside** this repo (`%USERPROFILE%\.cursor\projects\...\agent-transcripts\`). Copying the folder does **not** reopen the same Cursor thread.

After material work in a turn, copy the current transcript `.jsonl` into `Custom Label Database/docs/chats/<uuid>.jsonl` (overwrite the same uuid). Keep `docs/chats/README.md` updated with title + date.

A new chat on another computer still starts fresh in the UI. Point it at `docs/chats/` plus `docs/HANDOFF.md` so it can read what was said.

Do not rely on Cursor account sync for this. The in-folder copy is the portable chat.
